<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-LYON GRAND PRIX FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LYON, France 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first round matches at the $750,000 Lyon Grand Prix men's tennis tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat Filip Dewulf (Belgium) 6-4 6-7 (3-7) 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat Richey Reneberg (U.S.) 7-5 6-2.</p>
</text>
